# he_contains substring CUT FROM THE SNAPSHOT STORE'S OWN BYTES by the word's consonants. Claim IDs DV33-. Written once (no file may exist; the prefix checked absent).
# THE SOURCES DISTRIBUTED BY COMPUTATION — THE SEAT RULE BY ROW (the design): every spine row seats at the FIRST chapter-33 verse its own Hebrew marker cites (the
# dump's list read back), else at the seat of the nearest citing row before it in its piska, else at its head; every outside row at the verse it cites; every cite
# index name must be used by exactly the claims that own it. The seats printed and asserted against the design's table (the dry run: Benjamin's thirteen rows at 33:12,
